{"id":612,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"While usually kindhearted, it can be terrifying if angered. Tusks that can slice through steel beams are how Haxorus deals with its adversaries."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its resilient tusks are its pride and joy. It licks up dirt to take in the minerals it needs to keep its tusks in top condition."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its tusks are incredibly destructive. They can easily slice through a thick, sturdy steel column every time."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."},{"name":"Mold Breaker","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unimpeded by the Ability of the target."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":610,"name":"Axew","condition":null,"children":[{"id":611,"name":"Fraxure","condition":"Lv. 38","children":[{"id":612,"name":"Haxorus","condition":"Lv. 48","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[1,44],[1,206],[9,372],[12,269],[15,163],[18,337],[21,184],[24,242],[27,349],[30,784],[33,116],[36,406],[41,14],[46,200],[53,12],[60,416]],"machine":[332,34,784,280,523,370,242,91,38,434,913,337,349,406,525,89,283,203,263,206,374,411,416,447,63,442,67,490,200,398,182,240,156,179,46,157,317,799,184,421,214,555,707,164,241,57,129,14,36,